{"title":"Sellsword","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 26 Bandit that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/cutthroats-hone\">Cutthroats Hone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(archers only; rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sellsword\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/sellsword?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>63</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sellsword?lv=26\">Lv 26 <span>237</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sellsword?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>214</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sellsword?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>281</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sellsword?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>108</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/sellsword\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>25</b></td><td>89</td><td>18.3</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.6 · 3,750</td><td>63</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Trollbarrow\">Trollbarrow</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sellsword?lv=26\" title=\"Pick level 26\"><td><b>26</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>94</td><td>18.8</td><td>1,300</td><td class=\"muted\">282 · 26.3 · 3,900</td><td>237</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Trollbarrow\">Trollbarrow</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sellsword?lv=27\" title=\"Pick level 27\"><td><b>27</b></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>214</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Trollbarrow\">Trollbarrow</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sellsword?lv=28\" title=\"Pick level 28\"><td><b>28</b></td><td>106</td><td>19.9</td><td>1,400</td><td class=\"muted\">318 · 27.9 · 4,200</td><td>281</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Trollbarrow\">Trollbarrow</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sellsword?lv=29\" title=\"Pick level 29\"><td><b>29</b></td><td>111</td><td>20.5</td><td>1,450</td><td class=\"muted\">333 · 28.7 · 4,350</td><td>108</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Trollbarrow\">Trollbarrow</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"sellsword\" data-map-level=\"25\">Show level 25 on the map</button>\n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/daecbded50729378b2ac.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/22a21bd2c3659d72b4ef.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Werewolfpelt armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/cc4904e825091d9dd4ba.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Acid)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Ogrewax armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card